        {
          "text": "Weekly status meetings are a tax.\n\nFifteen people. One hour. Nothing decided.\n\nReplace them with a written update by noon Friday. Anyone with a blocker replies. The meeting only happens if someone does.\n\nWe cut four hours a week per person and lost nothing.",
          "postType": "opinion",
          "note": "Verdict, cost, replacement."
        },
        {
          "text": "Your onboarding doc is not the problem.\n\nNobody owns it.\n\nName one owner. Give them an hour each month. Ship it with a changelog.\n\nA doc with an owner stays true. A doc without one rots.",
          "postType": "how-to",
          "note": "Reframe, then a fix."
        },
        {
          "text": "Stop asking for feedback you will not use.\n\nIf the answer cannot change the plan, do not ask. You waste their time and spend your credibility.\n\nAsk only when a no would change what you do next.",
          "postType": "opinion",
          "note": "A rule with a test."
        }
