          "text": "It was a Tuesday, and the coffee machine was broken again.\n\nSo six of us stood in the kitchen and talked. Really talked, for the first time in weeks.\n\nThat is where our best idea of the quarter started. Not in a workshop. By a dead machine.\n\nMake room for the unplanned hallway.",
